<<investigateicon>><<link [[从根须间取出扁铜盒 (0:05)|MP Region Druid Rootcave]]>><<pass 5>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<money 1500>><</link>>
